ci: adopt canonical lanes workflow (Velnor Actions 2026.8.31) (#12)

Re-render .github/workflows/ci.yml from the velnor-actions-generator
canonical template (release 2026.8.31).

- Exact `lanes` workflow_dispatch input spec (velnor | github | both),
default velnor
- Velnor fleet default for pull_request/merge_group/schedule; push
routes to GitHub lane per fleet occupancy policy
- ci-required runs on Velnor by default, GitHub only when lane selects
it
- No hand edits: byte-identical render to the code class canonical

